  "description": "Details Pursuant to Condition 12 (Framework Travel Plan) of Planning Permission P1039.21 Dated 07-09-22 for Redevelopment of the St George's Hospital site to provide up to 4,629sq.m of new healthcare facility (Use Class E(e)) to include sub-station, generator, new vehicular and pedestrian access from Suttons Lane, associated car parking, landscape, and infrastructure works, involving demolition of existing buildings.",
